SUMMARY:DIY Garden Decor
DESCRIPTION:Decorate and beautify your garden\, yard\, or home with handmade decorations! In this workshop\, you will have the opportunity to explore a variety of materials (or bring your own) to design whimsical garden creations. From fairy houses and cardboard gnomes to collaged planter labels\, the possibilities are endless…if you can imagine it\, you can build it!\nPotential projects include:\nFairy houses made using toilet paper rolls and gemstones\nCardboard and papier-mâché gnomes sealed with ModPodge\nSigns pointing to your own imagined places\nCollaged planter labels\nOr anything you want to create!\nAGES 18+\nPrice: $40\nTime: 1:00-2:30pm\nWorkshop date:\nSunday\, May 24
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/diy-garden-decor-2/
LOCATION:Davis Arts Center\, 1919 F St.
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/DIY-GARDEN.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Davis Arts Center":MAILTO:office@davisartscenter.org
END:VEVENT
